✨ 01. PROJECT OVERVIEW

The Personal Portfolio Website is a modern frontend development project created as part of the Oasis Infobyte Web Development & Designing Internship — Level 1, Task 2.

The website represents my personal digital identity, showcasing my educational background, technical interests, development projects, community involvement, and professional contact information.

Designed with a premium Dark Black & Purple visual theme, the portfolio combines modern typography, elegant visual effects, structured content, and responsive layouts.

Its primary goal is to present my journey as an aspiring Software Engineer and provide visitors with a clear overview of my skills, interests, and development work.

Design Philosophy: Learn continuously. Build meaningfully. Innovate confidently.

